<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-gĕmĭno</span></b> ,
			āvi, ātum, 1, v. a.
		and n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to redouble</i>, <i>repeat</i>, <i>reiterate.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dextrā ingeminans ictus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 5, 457</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terrorem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 7, 578</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">liquidas voces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. G.
					1, 411</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox assensu nemorum ingeminata remugit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">me miserum! ingeminat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 653</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Val.
				Fl. 4, 328</span></i>. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to be redoubled</i>,
				<i>to increase</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingeminant austri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 333</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingeminant plausu Tyrii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					1, 747</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ignes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 199</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clamor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 5, 227</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingeminant curae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 531</span></i>
			.</div>
